  "description": "<p>When making a GET request to a LDPCv (timemap) with \"Accept: application/link-format\" the response must include links to each memento contained by the LDPCv.</p>\n\n<p>See: <a href=\"https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7089#page-37\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7089#page-37</a></p>\n\n<p>There should be a link for each memento with rel=\"memento\" and datetime=\"&lt;memento datetime of the memento in RFC-1123 format.</p>",
